{"i": 66, "code": "SC-2026-03", "no": "066", "ty": "单选", "d": "易", "p": "四川", "mod": "力学", "chap": "机械振动与机械波", "leaf": "简谐运动", "t1": "正向递推", "t2": "链式多步顺推", "src": "2026 四川 · 第 3 题", "stemHtml": "<p>如图所示，空气中水平放置两端开口的圆柱形长管、管内有a、b、c三个位置，a、b距离为<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"927\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">，c在b右侧。持续驱动活塞使其在a、b间做周期为<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"928\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"37\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">的简谐运动，管内形成稳定机械波。声波在空气中的传播速度取<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"929\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"69\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">，管足够长。则（ ）</p><p><span class=\"figbox\"><img class=\"qfig\" data-k=\"930\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"834\" height=\"272\" alt=\"图形\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span></p>", "stemText": "如图所示，空气中水平放置两端开口的圆柱形长管、管内有a、b、c三个位置，a、b距离为〔式〕，c在b右侧。持续驱动活塞使其在a、b间做周期为〔式〕的简谐运动，管内形成稳定机械波。声波在空气中的传播速度取〔式〕，管足够长。则（ ） 〔图〕", "options": [{"l": "A", "html": "管内机械波为横波", "text": "管内机械波为横波"}, {"l": "B", "html": "管内机械波的振幅为<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"927\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">", "text": "管内机械波的振幅为〔式〕"}, {"l": "C", "html": "管内机械波的波长为<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"927\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">", "text": "管内机械波的波长为〔式〕"}, {"l": "D", "html": "每秒有10个完整的波经过位置c", "text": "每秒有10个完整的波经过位置c"}], "answerHtml": "<p>D</p>", "answerText": "D", "analysisHtml": "<p>A．根据题意可知，管内机械波振动方向与传播方向平行，则管内机械波为纵波，故A错误；</p><p>B．活塞在<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"931\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">间做简谐运动，且<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"931\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">间距离为<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"927\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">，则管内机械波的振幅为<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"932\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">，故B错误；</p><p>C．管内机械波的波长为<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"933\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"132\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">，故C错误；</p><p>D．管内机械波的周期为<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"928\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"37\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">，则每秒有<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"934\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"44\" height=\"21\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">个完整的波经过位置<img class=\"qf\" data-k=\"935\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" alt=\"公式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">，故D正确；</p><p>故选D。</p>", "analysisText": "A．根据题意可知，管内机械波振动方向与传播方向平行，则管内机械波为纵波，故A错误； B．活塞在〔式〕间做简谐运动，且〔式〕间距离为〔式〕，则管内机械波的振幅为〔式〕，故B错误； C．管内机械波的波长为〔式〕，故C错误； D．管内机械波的周期为〔式〕，则每秒有〔式〕个完整的波经过位置〔式〕，故D正确； 故选D。", "nF": 13, "nFig": 1}